The first season received positive reviews for its action, comedy, nostalgia, and animation style, though some critics found the latter to be jarring at first.<ref name="RTReviewRoundup" /> The [[review aggregator]] website [[Rotten Tomatoes]] reported a 97% approval score with an average rating of 8.1/10, based on 38 reviews. The site's critical consensus reads: "Embracing the wholesome aesthetics of the webslinger's original comic run while adding some fresh plot wrinkles, this family-friendly ''Spider-Man'' is a lovable incarnation of the Marvel superhero."<ref name="S1RT">{{Cite Rotten Tomatoes |id=your_friendly_neighborhood_spider_man |title=Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man |type=tv |season=1 |access-date=February 11, 2025}}{{cbignore}}</ref> [[Metacritic]], which uses a weighted average, assigned a score of 77 out of 100 based on 10 critics, indicating "generally favorable" reviews.<ref name="S1MC">{{Cite Metacritic |id=your-friendly-neighborhood-spider-man |title=Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man |type=tv |season=1 |access-date=February 11, 2025}}{{cbignore}}</ref>

